**Files changed:**
1. `src/ini.ts` — implemented `parseIni(text): Ini` per the spec, with line-number tracking, section/comment handling, key=value split on first `=`, quoted value preservation, and `SyntaxError` for invalid lines.
2. `src/ini.test.ts` — added 20 tests covering: keys before header (under `''`), override, whitespace trimming (keys, values, section names), blank/whitespace-only lines ignored, full-line `;` and `#` comments (including leading whitespace), quoted values preserving inner spaces and `;`, first `=` splitting (`k=b=c`), inline `;` in unquoted values kept verbatim, empty sections existing as `{}`, `SyntaxError` with line number on no-equals line, bad section header (`[oops`, `[sec]x`), empty key (`=value`), and a full mixed-feature example.

